AArch64 SeqLockZ+rfi
"Expected: Allowed. Source: Coq memory/ARMBar.v, ARMBar.SeqLockZ.full_allowed (every SWP flavour). The Q6 outcome; test from the redesign plan. UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
